### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Login as admin (bootstrapped from ADMIN_EMAIL / ADMIN_PASSWORD)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@example.com", "password": "admin-change-me"}

### Register a customer account
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "jane@example.com", "password": "s3cure-password", "full_name": "Jane Doe"}

### Ingest knowledge-base documents (staff only)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/knowledge/ingest
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Refund Policy",
      "source_type": "policy",
      "content": "Customers may request a full refund within 30 days of purchase."
    }
  ]
}

### Ask a question (RAG answer with citations)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "What is your refund policy?", "customer_email": "jane@example.com"}

### Continue the conversation (memory)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "And how long does it take?", "conversation_id": "PASTE_CONVERSATION_ID"}

### Ask for a human (escalation + ticket + email draft)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "I want to talk to a real person", "customer_email": "jane@example.com"}

### Submit feedback
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{"conversation_id": "PASTE_CONVERSATION_ID", "rating": 5, "comment": "Very helpful!"}

### Search the vector store directly (staff only)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/knowledge/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{"query": "refund", "top_k": 3}

### List tickets (staff only)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tickets?status=open
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Update a ticket
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tickets/PASTE_TICKET_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{"status": "resolved"}

### Analytics overview (staff only)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/analytics/overview?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### WhatsApp inbound webhook (Twilio format)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/channels/whatsapp/webhook
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Body=What is your refund policy%3F&From=whatsapp:+15551234567
